WEBVTT

00:13:25.957 --> 00:13:32.924
Stanje brendiranja oduvijek je
odražavalo stanje kulture.

00:13:33.699 --> 00:13:35.786
Odgovorni smo

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:40.791
nastaviti jačati demokratsku moć
koju daje brendiranje,

00:13:40.815 --> 00:13:42.934
ali i

00:13:43.654 --> 00:13:45.720
dizajnirati kulturu koja oslikava

00:13:46.911 --> 00:13:48.307
i poštuje

00:13:49.317 --> 00:13:51.190
sliku svijeta u kakvom želimo živjeti.

00:13:51.741 --> 00:13:52.906
Hvala vam.

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:56.249
(Pljesak)